Three-term Democrat [[Bob Casey Jr.]], was [[2018 United States Senate election in Pennsylvania|reelected in 2018]] with 55.7% of the vote. Casey is running for a fourth term.<ref name=":1">{{Cite web |last=Wright |first=David |date=2023-04-10 |title=Pennsylvania Sen. Bob Casey will run for reelection, boosting Democrats' Senate outlook for 2024 |url=https://www.cnn.com/2023/04/10/politics/bob-casey-pennsylvania-reelection/index.html |access-date=2023-04-10 |website=CNN Politics |publisher=[[CNN]] |language=en |archive-date=April 10, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230410121029/https://www.cnn.com/2023/04/10/politics/bob-casey-pennsylvania-reelection/index.html |url-status=live }}</ref> He is being challenged by engineer Blaine Forkner.<ref name=bfpa>{{cite news |last1=Prose |first1=J.D. |title=Western Pa. progressive Democrat announces primary challenge to U.S. Sen. Bob Casey |url=https://www.pennlive.com/news/2023/09/western-pa-progressive-democrat-announces-primary-challenge-to-us-sen-bob-casey.html |access-date=September 26, 2023 |work=PennLive Patriot-News |publisher=Advance Local Media LLC |date=September 25, 2023 |archive-date=September 26, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230926182551/https://www.pennlive.com/news/2023/09/western-pa-progressive-democrat-announces-primary-challenge-to-us-sen-bob-casey.html |url-status=live}}</ref>

[[2022 United States Senate election in Pennsylvania|2022 Senate candidate]] [[David McCormick]] is the republican nominee.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.mcall.com/2023/09/21/republican-david-mccormick-makes-second-senate-bid-in-pennsylvania-aims-to-oust-democrat-bob-casey/ |title=Republican David McCormick launches 2nd Senate bid in Pennsylvania, aims to oust Democrat Bob Casey |date=September 21, 2023 |access-date=September 21, 2023 |archive-date=March 28, 2024 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20240328060546/https://playlist.stnvideo.com/player/data/index.php?cmd=loadInitial&session=f1R4DrjDilbuddT1&instance=198636388&version=7.30.7-DAL2&age=240328&ESG_key=yDXFiiit&type=FULL&EXTREF=https://www.mcall.com/2023/09/21/republican-david-mccormick-launches-2nd-senate-bid-in-pennsylvania-aims-to-oust-democrat-bob-casey/&REF=https://www.mcall.com/2023/09/21/republican-david-mccormick-launches-2nd-senate-bid-in-pennsylvania-aims-to-oust-democrat-bob-casey/&ogSet=1 |url-status=live}}</ref>

